        You will be given the root cause of a bug, the commit message and the corresponding patch.
        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by the `getMainArguments` method in `LauncherMapper.java`, which did not handle null or empty arguments properly. When the method attempted to populate the `args` array with these invalid values, it could lead to a Null Pointer Exception when the array was accessed or processed later in the workflow.

        Commit message:
        OOZIE-2748 NPE in LauncherMapper.printArgs() (pbacsko via
 rkanter)  

        Patch:
         import org.apache.hadoop.mapred.Reporter;

+import com.google.common.base.Strings;
